  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Added net9.0 as an explicit target framework alongside netstandard2.0/net8.0/net10.0 for broader compatibility. Added a PartnerId fallback on Partner Referral calls. 1.0.0: Initial release - Partner Referrals, Orders/Checkout, Payments, Webhooks with signature verification, Vault, Apple Pay, Shipment Tracking, and Managed Accounts (limited release), plus automatic OAuth2 token caching.",
